  _subtitle: The Good Witch of the South
  _description: The most powerful of the witches. She rules the Quadlings from [[9fb065b5-0eee-49d9-b272-25c0c46292d5|Glinda's
    Palace]] and tells [[fcbf3650-903d-4ed3-a6f8-79e222116920|Dorothy Gale]] the
    secret of the [[ea4cb543-34a9-48d6-9037-6af7bf319ac6|Silver Shoes]].
